      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Host: Render Web Service\nLimits: 512MB RAM, 0.1 vCPU\nBase: Python 3.11-slim\nUser: appuser (UID 1000)\n\n[Memory Hardening]\n- OMP_NUM_THREADS=1\n- ORT_THREAD_POOL_SIZE=1\n- MALLOC_TRIM_THRESHOLD_=100k\n- Peak RSS: ~140-180MB",
